'''Axoloty''' (ルーパールーパー, ''Rūpārūpā'', '''Looper Looper''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Big Sal]] found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Uncanny Legends]]. It was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

